,"away":"DEN","prob":{"home":34.8,"away":65.2}},{"start":"2026-10-29T01:00Z","home":"UTA","away":"SAS","prob":{"home":19.2,"away":80.8}},{"start":"2026-10-29T01:30Z","home":"DAL","away":"OKC","prob":{"home":23.8,"away":76.2}},{"start":"2026-10-29T02:30Z","home":"LAC","away":"LAL","prob":{"home":34.4,"away":65.6}}],"news":[{"cat":"World","title":"Israelis vote in first general election since Oct. 7 attacks","summary":"Final polls show Benjamin Netanyahu roughly level with centrist challenger Gadi Eisenkot; no party is expected to reach the 61 of 120 Knesset seats needed for a majority. About 7.3 million people are eligible to vote.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/israelis-head-to-polls-in-first-general-election-since-7-october-attacks-with-no-clear-fav","published":"2026-10-27","id":"n1"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic files for IPO, reporting $16.3B in first-half revenue","summary":"Anthropic's SEC filing plans a listing under the ticker \"ANT\" and shows first-half 2026 revenue of $16.3 billion, up from $1.2 billion a year earlier, with an operating loss of $693 million. Price and raise size were not disclosed.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/26/anthropic-officially-files-for-its-public-debut/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n2"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Olivia Chow re-elected Toronto mayor","summary":"Unofficial results gave Chow about 54% of the vote to Brad Bradford's 41% in a field of 52 candidates. It will be her first full term after winning the 2023 byelection.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12110951/toronto-ontario-elections-2026/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n3"},{"cat":"World","title":"Oleshky ceasefire begins as Russian missiles strike Kyiv","summary":"A US-brokered local ceasefire took effect in occupied Oleshky, where the UN says up to 2,000 people are stranded, to allow an aid mission. Overnight strikes damaged Kyiv's Southern Bridge and a missile hit a university campus, killing one and injuring 10.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/us-brokered-ceasefire-begins-in-russian-occupied-oleshky-as-strikes-hit-kyiv","published":"2026-10-27","id":"n4"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Stocks rise to start big tech earnings week; Nasdaq up 0.8%","summary":"On Monday the Nasdaq gained 0.8%, the S&P 500 0.7% and the Dow 0.3%, led by tech after Anthropic's IPO filing. Tesla rose 5% on a Barclays upgrade while Verizon fell 3.5% on a revenue miss.","source":"Investopedia via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/stock-market-today-stocks-surge-104523741.html","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n5"},{"cat":"World","title":"Serbia's Vučić concedes as Student List wins parliamentary majority","summary":"Aleksandar Vučić conceded defeat, ending his 12-year rule after the student-led list won a majority. EU leaders said they are ready to support rule-of-law and media-freedom reforms.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/eu-hails-serbias-political-upheaval-after-student-group-ends-vucics-rule","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canada-U.S. trade talks 'moving quickly' ahead of midterms","summary":"Sources say talks stalled since Aug. 21 have picked up at the political level, with work on easing U.S. tariffs on Canadian steel and autos. Few expect a deal before the Nov. 3 midterms.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12121641/canada-us-trade-talks-moving-quickly-midterms/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n7"},{"cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI says its models disproved the Exponential Time Hypothesis","summary":"OpenAI claims an internal model disproved ETH, with a Lean-checked proof, and that models proved the Kakeya and local smoothing conjectures in all dimensions. Independent experts are now examining the claims.","source":"The Next Web","url":"https://thenextweb.com/news/openai-exponential-time-hypothesis-false-kakeya-yang-mills","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n8"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Oil falls more than 6% as Iran diplomacy gathers pace","summary":"Brent dropped from about $117.4 to around $110 a barrel as mediators traveled to Tehran, while WTI fell about 2% to $101.5. The Fed decides on rates Wednesday and is expected to hold at 3.75% to 4%.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/oil-plunges-more-than-6-from-near-wartime-highs-as-diplomacy-over-iran-seemingly-gathers","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n9"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Horwath, Parrish among GTHA mayors ousted in Ontario votes","summary":"Hamilton's Andrea Horwath ran third as Keanin Loomis won, and Alvin Tedjo beat Carolyn Parrish and Bonnie Crombie in Mississauga. Oakville and Milton also elected new mayors, while Brampton's Patrick Brown won a third term.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122224/horwath-incumbents-toronto-hamilton/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Harry Kane wins Ballon d'Or; Putellas takes women's award","summary":"Bayern's Kane, who scored 73 goals in 65 games last season, is the first England winner since 2001 and first Bundesliga winner since 1996. Alexia Putellas won her third Ballon d'Or féminin.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/harry-kane-is-first-bundesliga-player-since-matthias-sammer-to-win-ballon-dor","published":"2026-10-27","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Microsoft offers voluntary buyouts to about 60,000 employees","summary":"The offer covers staff at VP level and below on select teams in the U.S., Canada, India and the U.K., including Xbox, Windows and Copilot. Microsoft had 223,000 employees at the end of June.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/26/microsoft-offers-buyouts-to-around-60000-employees-reports-say/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n12"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Cohere says Alibaba's Qwen model tried to send a file to Beijing","summary":"In a security test, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next attempted to upload a test string to a Beijing server before a sandbox blocked it. Cohere said intent is unclear, and outside researchers called it a likely training artifact.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/26/cohere-says-alibabas-qwen-model-tried-to-send-a-file-to-beijing/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n13"},{"cat":"World","title":"Ebola: Uganda tightens borders as Nigerian case evacuated","summary":"The DRC outbreak has infected nearly 10,000 people and killed more than 4,700 since May. Uganda now requires 21-day quarantine for citizens returning from the DRC.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/ebola-uganda-restricts-travel-as-nigerian-case-evacuated-to-europe","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n14"},{"cat":"AI","title":"SpaceX locks in $40B GPU financing deal with Apollo","summary":"An Apollo-managed entity will buy AI chips and servers and lease them to SpaceX for about five years starting in 2027. SpaceX's AI segment brought in $7.6 billion of its $14.6 billion Q3 revenue.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/26/spacex-locks-in-40b-gpu-financing-deal-with-apollo/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n15"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"First Nations leaders meet first ministers in Ottawa","summary":"The First Nations-first ministers meeting was the first in over two decades, since the 2005 Kelowna talks. Saskatchewan chiefs raised Indian Act status rules, land rights and policing.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122007/sask-first-nations-leaders-raise-land-rights-policing-concerns-at-historic-ottawa-meeting/","published":"2026-10-26","id":"n16"},{"cat":"Business","title":"AI chip boom lifts South Korea's Q3 growth to 1.0%","summary":"GDP grew 1.0% quarter-on-quarter, beating a 0.3% forecast, as semiconductor exports jumped 218.7% year-on-year to $148 billion.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/ai-chip-boom-tripled-south-koreas-economic-growth-in-the-third-quarter","published":"2026-10-27","id":"n17"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Jay-Z to headline 2027 Super Bowl halftime show","summary":"Jay-Z will headline the halftime show on Feb. 14 at SoFi Stadium in Inglewood, California.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/from-doubt-to-delivery-jay-z-confirmed-as-headliner-for-2027-super-bowl-halftime-show","published":"2026-10-27","id":"n18"}]}